    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδῐάω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδιόων, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔδιος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
			fair</i> or <i>calm</i>, of sea and weather, 
